question_text:
以下代码输出是？
```python
class A:
    def __init__(self):
        self.x = 1
class B(A):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.y = 2
b = B()
print(b.x, b.y)
```

correct_answer:
```python
class Dog:
    species = "Canis familiaris"
    def __init__(self, name, age):
        self.name = name
        self.age = age
    def bark(self):
        return f"{self.name} says: Woof!"
```

